# FRIC-017 disk-reclaim preflight binary (ADR-0548 pipeline-as-product). LOCAL BRIDGE
# feedback only (founder CLI-retirement directive): merge authority is the conformance
# gate test below, never this binary. The CI workflow invokes it as a runner preflight
# step BEFORE the buck-out warm restore (so it must build/run with ZERO dependency on the
# buck-out cache); its successor is a reconciler per ADR-0548 D3.
